{"session_id": "20260907T074200Z-232146", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:51:28+00:00", "language": "ml", "input_mode": "voice", "query": "Explain the pharma scheme.", "translated_query": "Central Government pharmaceutical schemes for farmers", "answer": "തന്നിരിക്കുന്ന വിവരങ്ങളിൽ ഫാർമ പദ്ധതിയെക്കുറിച്ച് (pharma scheme) വിശദീകരണമില്ല. അതിനാൽ, നിങ്ങൾ ഏതെങ്കിലും പ്രത്യേക പദ്ധതിയെക്കുറിച്ച് ചോദിക്കുന്നത് നന്നായിരിക്കും.", "citations": [{"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0019", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.8709920887496047}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0066", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Minikit Programme for Rice", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.6468930740148485}, {"chunk_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes::0057", "doc_id": "tnau-paddy-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pledge Loan Scheme", "source_type": "html", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\tnau-paddy-schemes.htm", "source_url": null, "page_number": null, "rerank_score": 0.5012037432779247}, {"chunk_id": "schemes::0000", "doc_id": "schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Fasal Bima Yojana", "source_type": "pdf", "source_path": "D:\\ai\\GenAIArchitect\\Buildathon05092026\\data\\raw\\SCHEMES.pdf", "source_url": null, "page_number": 2, "rerank_score": 0.32318181919944355}, {"chunk_id": "testbook-agri-schemes::0009", "doc_id": "testbook-agri-schemes", "scheme_name": "Pradhan Mantri Krishi Sinchayee Yojana", "source_type": "web", "source_path": "data\\raw\\testbook-agri-schemes.json", "source_url": "https://testbook.com/ias-preparation/agriculture-schemes-in-india", "page_number":